{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"partial derivative partial derivative","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","fileName":"Partial Derivative.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Partial Derivative","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 00:13\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Optimization and Differentiation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Optimization and Differentiation","Loss Function","Gradient","Hessian Matrix","algorithms.epub","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"partial derivative partial derivative","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","fileName":"Partial Derivative.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Partial Derivative","heading":"Partial Derivative","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A partial derivative measures how a function of several variables changes with respect to one variable while the others are held constant. It isolates the local effect of that variable on the output.\n\nFor a neural network, the variables include its many weights and biases and the output of interest is the [[Loss Function|loss]]. Collecting the partial derivatives for all parameters produces the [[Gradient]].\n\nSecond partial derivatives describe how these first-order rates change. Arranging every second and mixed partial derivative into a square array produces the [[Hessian Matrix]], which supports curvature tests and Newton-type optimization.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Optimization and Differentiation","Loss Function","Gradient","Hessian Matrix","algorithms.epub","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"partial derivative partial derivative","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Partial Derivative.md","fileName":"Partial Derivative.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Partial Derivative","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algorithms.epub]]\n\n[[appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Optimization and Differentiation","Loss Function","Gradient","Hessian Matrix","algorithms.epub","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}